  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A flag book construction:  the spine is an accordion fold.  Each "page" is in three parts, with the middle part attached to the front of a fold, upper and lower parts attached to the back.  When the accordion folds are stretched open the middle part falls to the right and upper and lower parts to the left.   Text is a letter home from Italy in 1954, from a military wife to relatives.  Text alternates with parts of a family photograph.  The family photograph becomes whole when the accordion folds are stretched and the pages fall open.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Upper and lower boards are covered in illustrated paper, an illustration of an American woman before a backdrop of Florence, Italy.</subfield>
  </datafield>
